    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποφᾰτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόφημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>negative,</i> opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφατικός, λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Cat.</u>
					12b8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.55
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				69
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίρρημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					245.24
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>APr.</u>
					64a14
				</span></i>
			; also written for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποφαντικῶς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				27.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>conclusive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLond.
				5.1902v
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>.</div>
